{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/7days.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A tale of Struggle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&quot;..destiny won't stay idle as we fight it..&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tag2.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0 </strong><br><strong>In their hunger for immortality humanity fought &quot;Death the Aeon&quot; but the battle was lost.. their hope was shattered.. and a curse was cast upon them..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/death.gif?t=1747130348\" /> <i><strong>&quot;Seven Days, Seven nights,\u00a0no more no less than one life.. will be left in Your World..&quot;\u00a0\u00a0 </strong></i><strong>.. but one hope remains, hidden in Guardiah Tower..</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the story unfolds you will Play as each character. Day after day you will witness the events from their point of view as the road to salvation is threatened by dark forces and each protagonist has a crucial role to play. With the chosen entering Guardiah, a knight seeking hope, a mage looking for answers and the monsters rebelling to humanity, the story will keep you engaged till the very end.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tag3.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Each protagonist has its own unique style and abilities and every level changes the way you play. From stealthy thieves to knights and mages, you will play as both humans and monsters. Each level will prompt you with different challenges with levels based on combat, stealth, speed, cleverness. An ever changing gameplay that will keep your playthrough always fresh. The system relies solely on your skills: no gear, no loot to praise, just your ability !  <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/steam1.gif?t=1747130348\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lore and fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tag1.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 <br>While exploring you will find many books that will allow you to expand your knowledge of The Worlds in the library, while not mandatory there's plenty of Lore if you want to better understand the events of the world. Ten bad fates are there for you to discover while screwing up with many ways to die. An extra feature is the secret pleasure of Skipping Cutscenes to see what happens.. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Reaplayable !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tag4.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0  <br> The game offers High Replayability with secret feats, a Monster difficulty that let's you play an harder version of the level and adds handicaps to your heroes. Achievements to unlock and an optional &quot;Runner mode&quot; designed to test your speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An Outstanding Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tim.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fantastic soundtrack for an epic story, Fate of Fire boasts 32 tracks composed by the amazing <strong>Tim Beek</strong>. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Have fun Saving Humanity !   </strong> <br><strong>Denis ^^</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/characters5.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Sight of Guardiah","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e7505e49ec5b4debec76559da602ac987fdf9dba.jpg"},{"name":"A shared burden","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/d5d96dd7ac0fb488cb1a04417f68f698c62ac733.jpg"},{"name":"The empty hall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/886ab8f1a107e532cc720dc799953a8e5318c4f5.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/e62095132af19aa006186ca8df5cf7d21a49062b.jpg"},{"name":"Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/a97ed903719cf3b733fbec503a0bd611058894f4.jpg"},{"name":"Deaf Man Walking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/c36e60bead16777e8cb0f2ea5e2ce5a1dc638283.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/71bd3423af6c4cbca475d0fb2afe00bc144f2551.jpg"},{"name":"Death Spoke","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/4e92c84098bb5479213b05c803a0b3bc4db22f4d.jpg"},{"name":"The Fate Changer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/8c5fbc055fa7ea5f3b09eda8f2f7f23c9f7ceb83.jpg"},{"name":"A lesson in magic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3085800/8fe1a83c03f825744d4d1c90590257eede3ca22c.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/sto