paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tag4.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0  <br> The game offers High Replayability with secret feats, a Monster difficulty that let's you play an harder version of the level and adds handicaps to your heroes. Achievements to unlock and an optional &quot;Runner mode&quot; designed to test your speed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>An Outstanding Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/tim.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fantastic soundtrack for an epic story, Fate of Fire boasts 32 tracks composed by the amazing <strong>Tim Beek</strong>. <br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Have fun Saving Humanity !   </strong> <br><strong>Denis ^^</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/extras/characters5.png?t=1747130348\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Denis Johan Tales"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3085800/0fd8dee92c82e82d9704818cc3924c4a87403d2c/header.jpg?t=1747130348","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257136615,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steams